---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: ProjectLearningGoal[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for designProject. Invent a coherent setting and challenge that naturally requires the target skills. Design meaningful roles and alternative solution paths, avoid making one learner a passive spectator, and include authentic constraints without introducing inaccessible prerequisites. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
